# ─── Build artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `python build.py` regenerates them; they are not versioned (dist/ is ~200 MB).
# The release ZIP (~90 MB) is attached to the GitHub release, not to the repository.
build/
dist/
*.zip
*.spec.bak

# ─── Analysis cache and results ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# The spectrograms and the report are program output, not sources.
_spectrograms/
_espectrogramas/
flac_verifier_report.pdf

# ─── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
venv/
.venv/
env/
.python-version

# ─── Tools and editors ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.Rhistory
.RData
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# ─── System ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ─── Test audio ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The tests generate their own fixtures in a temporary directory, so no .flac
# should ever reach the repository.
*.flac
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
!tests/fixtures_*.flac

# ─── Loose debug output ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
_salida*.txt
# Temporary dumps of a script's own output: never part of the project.
_*.txt

# ─── Old exports ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# README.html is a stale render of the README (it said "54 tests"): README.md is
# the real one, so the HTML is not published.
README.html
